  "slug": "claude-relay",
  "name": "Claude Relay",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Let local Claude Code sessions talk to each other in natural language.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 command** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `setup-pre-commit` (Set up Husky pre-commit hooks with lint-staged running Prettier + ESLint, plus a full typecheck/lint/format/test gate, using the…)\n- **Commands** (1): `relay-rename` (Rename this Relay session)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `relay`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-relay@claude-community` from `Innestic/claude-relay`.",
